; Tall enough to reach the FLOOR. Player root is capsule-centred, so this spans from the feet to
; head height. It once started 0.92 m up and swung straight over short enemies - swarmlings were
; literally unhittable (measured 26 cm of clear air), so the floor-reaching part is load-bearing.
;
; Every number in this scene was divided by 1.28 along with the player, who had been scaled up to
; 2.43 m by mistake. The RATIOS are what matter here, not the absolute sizes.
[sub_resource type="BoxShape3D" id="hit"]
size = Vector3(1.5625, 1.6406, 1.4062)

