; The swing streak. Child of Blade so it rides the hand socket with the visual blade.
;
; NO transform here on purpose: sword.gd MEASURES BladeMesh's AABB at _ready and spans the ribbon
; across it, so a different blade mesh (longer sword, dagger) gets a correctly sized trail with no
; numbers to update. Likewise none of the ADDON's own properties are stored here — that keeps its
; setters from running before its _ready() has built draw_pass_1, and guarantees every instance
; owns its material instead of sharing one. seconds/color below are BladeTrail's own, and safe.
[node name="Trail" type="GPUParticles3D" parent="Blade"]
script = ExtResource("4_trail")
seconds = 0.24
color = Color(0.7, 0.85, 1, 1)

